The following inventory combines the recorded run notes in the supplied report with the later y+ = 60 and nose-box checks. The older mesh-study cases are distinct from the later wall-layer tests; keep their different outputs separate. Original logs/case folders for every historical run are not available here, so older entries are transcribed from the recorded report.

